"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"31d813d8488beb16\" href=\"?note=31d813d8488beb16\" title=\"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines\">43-df-lowforcomputable-machines</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书的逆向构造把相对机器分为有限小权重片段，使用可计算强数组迹，再由具有可计算总权重的Kraft–Chaitin请求构造普通可计算机器。本次核对等价陈述与构造框架，未独立重证全部估计。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines","status":"resolved","id":"31d813d8488beb16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines","status":"resolved","id":"31d813d8488beb16","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1335,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-395","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char]] — 可计算机器低性与可计算可迹性"},{"id":"2c0b8291767d13ef","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。机器低性采用 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]、[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]] 的接口；可计算可迹性的等价刻画见 [[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]、[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char]]。"}],"outgoing":["31d813d8488beb16","abd2ac3cf0e63c86"]}